35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The transport costs are the biggest variable, but public beds are surprisingly cheap.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The canteen closure means we need a place with staff, or we lose two hours daily.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,The seniors confirm that mixing only happens when we sleep together.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
