40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, does the public rate include equipment? That changes the budget significantly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, yes, the rate sheet includes hall and equipment use in the 1,100 yen charge.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, if the rooms are that crowded, will the training quality suffer?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, yes, the sleep deprivation from last year already hurt the final sessions.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, the non-refundable deposit means we need a firm headcount before booking.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The public option is cheaper, but the transport cost for a distant location is high.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The lottery application is a nightmare if dates shift, but the cost is low.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"The attendance sheets show a fifth never came, likely due to the commute or cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The campus hall is split between early mornings and late evenings, which is inefficient.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"A third of the club can't make the 9 AM start without a bed, so campus is out.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"We need a balance between cost, logistics, and social integration.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The public centre offers the best value if we can manage the booking risk.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,Sleeping together is the only way to fix the year-group divide.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I prefer a place with better sleep conditions, but the public option is viable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"The financial risk of the lodge is high, but the public option is safer for the budget.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
